%% Resume document processing
flowchart TB
  subgraph Admission[Document Admission]
    direction LR
    File[One Resume File] --> Checks[Extension Signature and Size Checks]
    Checks --> Type{PDF or DOCX}
  end
  subgraph Extraction[Text Extraction]
    direction LR
    PDF[Native PDF Text] --> Sparse{Enough Text?}
    Sparse -->|No| OCR[Render Pages and Run OCR]
    DOCX[DOCX Paragraphs and Tables] --> Normalize[Normalized Resume Text]
    Sparse -->|Yes| Normalize
    OCR --> Normalize
  end
  subgraph Profile[Profile Construction]
    direction LR
    Gemini[Schema-Constrained Profile] --> Verify[Normalize Fields]
    Verify --> Save[Persist Owned Candidate Resources]
  end
  Type -->|PDF| PDF
  Type -->|DOCX| DOCX
  Normalize --> Gemini
